  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) support to floods affected population in Sindh and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support the floods affected population through provision of accessible, safe and resilient drinking water facilities and sanitation services in districts Sanghar, Mirpurkhas, Shaheed Benazirabad, and Jacobabad in Sindh province and district Chitral in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa province.</narrative>
  </description>
